  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_01",
      "hash": "1a5cdf115cd02093",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「哎呀！\\n這不是[VAR TRNAME(0000)]嘛！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_02",
      "hash": "1a5ce0115cd02246",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳在這種地方幹什麼！？\\c\\n難、難道[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢\\n死掉了嗎……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_07",
      "hash": "1a5ce5115cd02ac5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "什麼嘛，原來不是這樣啊！\\n那真是太好了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_03",
      "hash": "1a5ce1115cd023f9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不過還是讓我來測試看看\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢狀態如何吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_04",
      "hash": "1a5ce2115cd025ac",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不過還是讓我來測試看看\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢們狀態如何吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0510_dummy_01",
      "hash": "82e4e19e96a8c773",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_05",
      "hash": "1a5ce3115cd0275f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "啊，糟了！\\n只顧著對戰，\\r\\n卡拉卡拉不知道跑哪裡去了！\\c\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳知道卡拉卡拉嗎？\\n牠是一種頭上戴著骨頭的寶可夢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0510_rival_06",
      "hash": "1a5ce4115cd02912",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我看到的那隻卡拉卡拉\\n好像正在尋找什麼的樣子。\\c\\n不知道牠是不是\\n到更上面的樓層去了……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p01_cave_d1702",
      "hash": "4bd5a9dd2723f11a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 8]"
    },
